id=10
title=SINGLE-FAULT ISOLATION
objective=Restore isolated fault detection.
hint=Exactly one fault channel must be active.
briefing=Three independent monitoring channels report fault conditions. Activate the isolation indicator only when exactly one channel reports a fault. If no channels report a fault or two or three channels report faults, this diagnostic indicator must stay OFF. Multi-channel incidents are handled by a separate system.
